# The build context is BASE_DIR, which on a live install also holds the
# ComfyUI checkout, the venv, SageAttention and backups (100+ GB). Whitelist
# only what the image build needs.
#
# spark-comfyui.sh itself was whitelisted here until 2026-08-08. No stage ever
# COPYs it (the image runs container/entrypoint.sh, not the host tool), so all
# it did was put a file in the context that nothing read. lib/ is excluded for
# the same reason and never needed an entry: the whitelist is a default-deny.
*
!mods
!mods/**
!container
!container/**
!comfyui-patches.list
